Package: unraid-vsock-sensors-hwmon
Version: @DEBIAN_VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: François HOYEZ <francois.hoyez@gmail.com>
Depends: dkms, build-essential, kmod, systemd
Recommends: lm-sensors
Description: Publish Unraid temperatures as native hwmon sensors
 Receives cached disk and HBA temperatures from an Unraid VM over AF_VSOCK
 and exposes them through the Linux hwmon subsystem on a Proxmox host.
